build: do not rebrand external GitHub organisations

The mechanical dash->lks replacement also renamed the 'dashpay' GitHub
organisation to 'lkspay', which broke the bls-signatures download in
depends/packages/bls-dash.mk:

  https://github.com/lkspay/bls-signatures/archive -> 404

bls-signatures is an external library maintained by Dash; its upstream
coordinates must be preserved exactly like the library name itself
(bls-dash, not bls-lks). Restore 'dashpay' everywhere, including the
documentation links that point at upstream repositories.
